    <name>Felsenspitz – Silbermannstein Runde von Straß</name>
    <desc>Distance: 4.777km, Estimated duration: 1.29h, Elevation up: 62.20328163910318m, Elevation down: 62.20328163910324m, Grade: easy</desc>
